This is a maintained fork of desertwitch/LLDP-unRAID.

Issues and pull requests are welcome at:

  https://github.com/davidcoulson/LLDP-unRAID

Please keep changes small and focused, and describe how you tested them
(Unraid version, and whether the LLDP service was running). Run `php -l`,
`bash -n` and `shellcheck` on anything you touch.

The original upstream project (no longer maintained) asked for contributions by
e-mail to its author; that does not apply to this fork.
